{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_02",
  "title": "排演一出悲剧",
  "storyCode": "AD-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eb4159f6f65a82cb14cd328bc66cdc089df00d9435c577fb1e15c2fad5e553ec",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深夜，本应空无一人的道具间传来细碎的声响和被压抑的悲鸣。\n幽暗的角落里，道具假人没有五官的面孔被闪烁的荧光打亮。\n蒂比抱着靠枕缩在沙发里，持刀的凶手发出邪恶的笑声，刀尖闪着刺眼的白光，下一秒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "经典！震撼！不愧是我最喜欢的恐怖电影，哪怕是三十多年前的小成本制作，跟现在的新片比起来也毫不逊色！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......还是看恐怖片比较能发泄情绪，我好像没有那么焦虑了。谢谢你的邀请，小蒂比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大声喊出来舒服多了吧，谢莉小姐？我就说你不是故意打断拍摄的，只是最近神经太紧绷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，虽然还有一些问题没解决......但今晚就让我忘记它们吧。接下来我们看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "应有尽有，恐怖电影之夜才刚刚开始呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？莫丽，你怎么一直不说话，是不喜欢这部电影吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "电影里出现的武器刀刃太过轻薄，如果是我就干脆设计更特殊的武器，在侧面加上血槽，视觉上的冲击力也更强！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别再想工作了！莫丽！你是不是跟谢莉小姐待太久了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喵~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？你怎么在这里呀，神秘的小家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "美丽的生物缓步走到两个小女孩中间，展示般地伸了一个懒腰，端坐在沙发前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫丽你看，她好像真的很喜欢我们欸。那就跟我们一起看电影吧！可别被吓到了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？谁的终端响了？莫丽，是你的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我得......先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她的脸色好差，不会是因为白天的事被格蕾塔女士问责了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫丽，明天我们再帮她分担一些工作吧？谢莉小姐看上去真的很疲惫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来！我们接着看电影，下一部恐怖片拿过最佳设计奖哦，置景、道具和武器都做得非常酷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "荧光闪烁，两个女孩再次沉浸在新的惊悚故事里，丝毫没注意到脚边的Miss.Christine也已悄无声息地离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢莉？你不是应该在跟小蒂比她们看电影吗，急匆匆的是要到哪里去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "语气亲昵的男子注意到谢莉的右手紧紧抓着终端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我知道了......突然收到了约会邀请？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一会儿可别对对方露出这样沉重的表情啊，他会伤心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟你无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的嘴唇在颤抖。你很冷，还是说在害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可怜的小人儿，你也跟我一样，被道尔顿的意外吓坏了是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别忧心了，有你这样认真的统筹在，我相信接下来一切都会很顺利的。来，让我给你个拥抱，你会暖和一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“跟你一样”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从你的甜言蜜语里可听不到半点恐惧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的忘性已经大到能将五年前发生的事从脑子里抹得一干二净了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没办法“跟你一样”没心没肺......别忘了，你也要为当初的坠亡事故负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迈克尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深夜，二楼的办公室突兀地亮起灯。\n一张办公桌上，文件夹中的纸质材料被整齐地收纳着，几乎看不出有人使用的痕迹。\n而另一张桌子上，通告单杂乱无章，布满修改痕迹，似乎字迹的主人正被什么困扰。\n一个高挑的身影在办公桌附近翻找着什么，动作精准利落，没发出一丝声响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "碎纸机有近期使用过的痕迹。\n卢西恩打开废纸盒，在大量碎纸条中捡出了触感特别的几条——那些不是剧组的打印纸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“特里蒙大学”......“环境监测”......签字是......格蕾塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是谢莉所说的“奇怪的文件”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他感觉自己的肩膀被轻轻推了一下，像一声认同。但办公室内除自己外再无旁人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欢迎回来，Miss.Christine。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近你散步的次数变多了，是找到什么感兴趣的东西了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里比想象中更有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卢西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，我也发现了意料之外的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......别多想......你只是来确认究竟是谁的恶作剧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你亲眼看着那个号码作废，不可能是那个人......不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "谢莉努力平复着自己的心情，观影时刻意遗忘的恐惧和焦虑此刻再度淹没了她。\n“去仓库，去赎你的罪。”\n终端屏幕在寂静的仓库里微微发光，发信人一栏里跳动着谢莉熟悉却难以面对的名字——“劳拉”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁在那里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要再装神弄鬼了，我现在很清楚这条消息不是我的幻觉！你到底要干什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无人回应。黑暗吞没了老旧仓库里所有残存的声音。\n细小的电流声簌簌作响，远处货架上的顶灯倏地亮起。\n诡异而充满诱惑，谢莉控制不住地向光源走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢莉小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......劳拉......是你吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "谢莉再次颤抖起来，她无法分辨这声音究竟来自仓库深处，还是自己的臆想。\n她怔怔地向前走着，恍然如回到了五年前的摄影棚，悲剧一幕的开场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢莉，谢莉！我又新加了一场戏，需要用一下威亚，你可以帮我准备一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狂妄......自傲......目中无人......你是个在蓝卡坞刚刚起步的新人，怎么敢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "道尔顿先生说他已经征得了导演的同意，这个应该是已经定下了的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "风头正盛的道尔顿想教训你，你却还误以为他是真的想帮你......结果呢，你满意了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他还没来吗......我都在威亚上吊了好几个小时了，腿和胳膊估计已经磨破皮了......谢莉，你能帮我问问他们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是“一个统筹”而已，只配帮你准备威亚和设备，保证它们是......安全的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你做到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "谢莉走到货架前，灯光明晃晃地照着一个黑色的防尘袋，她知道里面是什么。\n不要打开，谢莉，不要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "防尘袋里装着一套老旧的威亚设备，挂钩和吊索磨损严重，保护带也几近断裂。\n黑色的布料上附着着一些深色的斑块。\n那是劳拉的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不！你不可能知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是我的幻觉！你不可能还活着！对了......疼痛......钢笔，我带了钢笔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......可悲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么你还在......为什么没有用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五年前的事故，究竟是意外还是谋杀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是意外......是意外！要不是道尔顿故意为难你，根本没有后面的惨剧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么不检查我身上的设备？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我恨你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我恨你自私、傲慢，把剧组的日程搞得一团糟，所有人的工作都被你无理取闹的要求影响！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "道尔顿想要教训你，那当然好！我那天像往常一样检查威亚设备，却发现它正好到了更换日期......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我脑中滑过一个很小很小的念头，要是你出了意外彻底消失......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢莉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈......那不就更好了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只手将神情恍惚的谢莉推倒在地，她听到制冷剂在管道中汩汩流动，板结的冰霜在她身下缓缓开裂。\n谢莉这才意识到，自己不知不觉走进了仓库尽头的冷库。\n砸门？吼叫？谢莉已无力挣扎。\n......\n恐惧不知不觉消失了，她感到前所未有的放松。\n......\n......\n死亡给了她所有谜题的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
